WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 11.17 · Fundraising, Revenue & Sustainable Business Models
Case for support and proposal development

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
A clear case links need, response, evidence and one specific request.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Say why it matters, why now and why you.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Ask for something bounded, costed and reportable.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Develop proposals in stages, and submit before the deadline.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Riverside Repair Hub (Hybrid · charity with a trading company, United Kingdom)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Riverside: fund 12 repair cafés on two estates for £14,850; we report items fixed, kg diverted and who took part.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You draft your case for support and proposal plan.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
